<div>
    <h3>Hi {{.UserEmail}},</h3>
    <p>We received a request to change your account email to {{.NewEmail}}. If you made this request, please click the link below to confirm the change:</p>
    <p><a href="{{.ChangeLink}}">Confirm Email Change</a></p>
    <p>This link will expire in {{humanDuration .Expiry}}.</p>
    <p>If you did not request an email change, please ignore this email.</p>
</div>
